    "d200": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "Welcome to the Dungeon Bank! I keep adventurers' coin secure, organized, and ready for approved dungeon services. What can I help you with?"
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "[Open my account.]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "run_command",
              "target": "player",
              "command": "tensuradungeon bank open {player}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "literal": "[Learn about deposits.]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d201"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[Ask about withdrawals.]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d210"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[Explain Bank grades.]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d220"
        }
      ]
    },
    "d201": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "A sound place to begin. The Bank accepts Bronze, Silver, Gold, and Stellar Gold coins from your nine hotbar slots or your offhand. Coins elsewhere in your inventory are not offered for deposit."
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "[So only my hotbar and offhand are checked?]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d202"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[What if I choose a stack?]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d202"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[Back to the Bank desk.]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d200"
        }
      ]
    },
    "d210": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "Withdrawals are simpler: select one occupied virtual Bank stack. You receive exactly the amount displayed in that slot, up to sixty-four coins, and withdrawals are never taxed."
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "[So I withdraw one displayed stack with no tax?]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d211"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[What if my inventory is full?]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d211"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[Back to the Bank desk.]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d200"
        }
      ]
    },
    "d220": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "Every account begins at Normal Grade with eighteen slots and a one-percent deposit tax. A higher grade adds nine slots and one percentage point of tax. Bank grade is purchased here; dungeon floors and adventurer rank do not raise it."
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "[So bigger Banks have a higher deposit tax?]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d221"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[Show me every grade and price.]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d222"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[How do I upgrade my Bank?]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d230"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[Back to the Bank desk.]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d200"
        }
      ]
    },
    "d202": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "Correct. You select one quoted stack, and the Bank processes that exact stack as one transaction. It will not quietly gather matching coins from your other slots or take only part of the selected stack."
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "[So the selected stack is deposited all at once?]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d203"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[Explain eligible slots again.]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d201"
        },
        {
          "literal": "[Back to the Bank desk.]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": [],
          "goto_node": "d200"
        }
      ]
    },
    "d211": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "Correct. Your inventory must be able to receive the complete stack. If it cannot, the withdrawal is rejected and your Bank balance remains unchanged. I do not drop financial assets onto the floor."
      },
      "actions": [],
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "literal": "[So no room means no withdrawal and no lost balance?]",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
