      "line": {
        "literal": "Genesis V has 108 slots at 11%, costing 75 Stellar Gold; VI has 117 at 12% for 125; VII has 126 at 13% for 200; VIII has 135 at 14% for 300; and IX has 144 at 15% for 500. Genesis IX is the maximum."
